  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a21748b6b89991d9cf65e3caefdfa2af43fb2f10_0.webp\" alt=\"Mizuno 的更好作物\"></p><hr><p>這個資源包受到 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252f3d-crops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">3D crops Revamped</a> 的啟發。<br>\n我製作它是為了讓我的 Mizuno 世界中的作物看起來更好看。<br>\n目前僅適用於胡蘿蔔、馬鈴薯、小麥和甜菜根。</p><hr><p><strong>我所有的 Mizuno 附加包</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 的更好樹葉</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">非官方 Mizuno's</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 的連接紋理</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x 清新動畫</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 的深色模式</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 的連接玻璃</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 的進食動畫</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizunos-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 的更好草地</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizunos-better-crops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 的更好作物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com